oq_append(TXI, 9, "**[2026-10-26 open-question hunt]** Still open. Searched again: the statute (s.125ג(ב) \"שלא יעלה על 25%\" against (ג)(1) \"בשיעור של 15%\") and the 2025 guide (p.40 defines a fixed rate; p.41 \"תחויב במס בשיעור של 15%, ותירשם בסעיף 13\"; the maximum-rate examples omit 13 and 21): every text words 15% as fixed, none classes it (TXI-19). Would settle it: a Tax Authority sentence or a form 1301 computation note on sections 13 and 21.")

