         "One line in the 2025 guide, inside an item on unlinked traded bonds issued before 8.5.2000, reads that \"דמי ניכיון על מק\"מ\" are taxed at 20% at realization. It conflicts with s.125C(c) and looks like legacy text (open question 3).",
